    "text": "A box sold outside North America from August 2014 in place of the Mega Charizard Collection, whose figures raised safety concerns. Each held a jumbo M Charizard-EX, the Mega Charizard X or Mega Charizard Y card from Flashfire, a cosmos holofoil copy of Legendary Treasures' Charizard, found in no booster pack, and three booster packs. In North America the Mega Charizard Collection held the same Charizard with a figure and four booster packs.",
